WebVoyager_data.jsonl and reference_answer.json are vendored verbatim from

  WebVoyager — https://github.com/MinorJerry/WebVoyager
  He et al., "WebVoyager: Building an End-to-End Web Agent with Large Multimodal Models"
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Vendored (not fetched at run time) so the task set is pinned: a benchmark whose input
can change upstream between runs is not reproducible. The copy here is byte-identical to
both the upstream repo and to the copy lumen ran (verified 2026-08-01 by diff).

No modification was made to the files. Date adaptation happens at load time in
dataset.mjs, never on disk.
